NODE id=matrix/cortex/store.Store.SetMeta kind=method
  digest=b3:712bf96eaa3abc53228d6d1b44ac55338947e55cb4ba4548b4f397b03849ba9d file=cortex/store/store.go range=365:378 lang=go exported=true byte_range=11474:12129
  sig=func (s *Store) SetMeta(key, value []byte) error
  doc=SetMeta writes value at the given meta/<key>. Restricted to keys with\nthe meta/ prefix so callers can't bypass journaled writes by smuggling\nstate into m/ or vec/ via this surface.\n\nIntended use: derived-state progress markers (Phase 5's embed_cursor,\nembed_vertex_next). Such markers are recomputable by walking the\njournal forward from seq=0, so they live OUTSIDE the journaled-batch\ndiscipline that protects canonical state (§11.1).
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/cortex/store.Store
  ^defines=matrix/cortex/store/store.go

NODE id=matrix/cortex/store.Store.SetVault kind=method
