  doc=SetVault wires the fail-closed data-at-rest session and owning user DID into\nthe store. MUST be called immediately after Open, before any write or read,\nand never concurrently with either (boot-time wiring, same posture as every\nother SetVault in the repo). A nil session leaves the store on legacy\nplaintext (dev/CLI).
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/cortex/store.Store
  ^defines=matrix/cortex/store/vaultseam.go

